      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors worked out the method and formula of indirect determination of the left ventricular and diastolic pressure (LVEDP) on the basis of the determined direct relationship between the diastolic-systolic coefficient (DSC) of the differential chest rheogram (difTPCR) and the LVEDP value measured by direct method in patients with IHD. LVEDP = 18.4x + 5.5, where x = DSC TPCR. It was determined that difTPCR can help to determine the degree of the heart failure and to find out patients with unfavourable prognosis."},
